### Nighttime Sleep
- This is the area I want to flag: Ford''s nights are showing a pattern of **frequent waking and fragmented stretches**. Looking at last night, he had three separate night chunks (~3h, ~3h, ~3h 38m) with wake-ups in between. The night before was similar — multiple segments of 2–3 hours.
