For the rest of the day: Nap 2 starts at 1:25 PM, capped at 60 minutes (waking by 2:25 PM). This brings total daytime sleep to ~2h 57m, right at the 3h budget. Then a last wake window of approximately 2h 40m (160 minutes) puts bedtime at ~7:05 PM, which aligns well with Ford''s recent bedtimes (7:00 PM on Apr 8, 7:13 PM on Apr 7, 7:10 PM on Apr 6). This schedule keeps the day balanced and should support a better night.', '2026-04-09 15:52:35.791277+00', '943043c9-1a70-4e80-aa5f-ffb20139158f'),
