n, we need to distribute roughly 3h of daytime sleep across two naps while hitting a ~7:00 PM bedtime. Last night was very fragmented — Ford had three separate night sleep blocks (7:24 PM–1:55 AM, 2:20 AM–4:50 AM, 5:35 AM–6:40 AM) totaling about 10h 6m but with significant wake time overnight. This sleep debt suggests we should not push wake windows too long, especially the first one.

